              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "dignitās, dignitātis — \"worth, rank, dignity\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Dignitātem suam semper servāvit. He always kept his dignity."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "dignitās, dignitātis f., built on dignus, worthy. A Roman's dignitās is his rank and good name. English dignity."
            }
          ]
